I am using the following solution to get the probabilities. Please let me know if you see an error

latCoef  <- parameterEstimates(fit)[4,4]
thrCoef  <- parameterEstimates(fit)[7,4]
latEst <- predict(fit)
x  <- latCoef*as.numeric(latEst) + -thrCoef
plot( x,
      as.numeric(d)-1)
grid(NULL, NULL)
lines(x[order(x)],  as.vector(pnorm(x[order(x)])) )

