So your assignment is to respond to this hypothetical forum post?  Sounds like cheating to go to an actual forum and ask for other people's responses.  This forum is specifically for lavaan users who need help solving issues with using the software, not a general SEM/stats forum like SEMNET or stats exchange.  But here is an article that might get you started on formulating your own answer:

http://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1207/s15328007sem1302_2#.VM_qPGjF98E

The Abstract indicates it has information relevant to the issues raised in your hypothetical forum post.

