You have two variables, x and y, measured at two time points:

mod.cl <http://mod.cl> <- "
x2 ~ x1 + y1
y2 ~ x1 + y1

y2 ~~ y1
x2 ~~ x2
"

fit.cl <http://fit.cl> <- sem(mod.cl <http://mod.cl>, data=myData)
summary(fit.cl <http://fit.cl>)

(Note, untested code).

Jeremy

